<title>POLAND: JELFA OCT NET DOUBLES TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>JELFA OCT NET DOUBLES TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.43 vs   1.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.62 vs   2.17</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.64 vs   2.21</p>
<p> Sales		   12.99 vs   9.59</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    18.08 vs  13.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	26.31 vs  20.61</p>
<p> Operating profit    24.96 vs  20.88</p>
<p> Sales		  122.61 vs 104.65</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish drug maker is Jelfa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
